{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-def-4","kind":"definition","title":"有理面积、无理面积及其对应线段","englishTitle":"And let the square on the assigned straight line be called rational and those areas which are commensurable with it rational, but those which are incommensurable with it irrational, and the straight lines which produce them irrational, that is, in case the areas are squares, the sides themselves, but in case they are any other rectilineal figures, the straight lines on which are described squares equal to them.","book":10,"number":4,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.def_1.4","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.def_1.4/","group":"def_1","sourceNumber":4,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":false,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-def-4@raw-e239735181e771ee","contentId":"euclid-10-def-4","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e239735181e771ee7629cad39062e6d41c03be3b78e70cbe0b95ebfff293f1fd","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-def-4.statement","euclid-10-def-4.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-def-4.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-def-4","revisionId":"euclid-10-def-4@raw-e239735181e771ee","order":0,"kind":"definition","title":"定义陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4128671f6ccde12a1c3ac58186a25ede552f2f18d28ee397afa29cda187b08bc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let the square on the assigned straight line be called rational and those areas which are commensurable with it rational, but those which are incommensurable with it ir